<title>FRANCE: Worms may open Athena capital - paper.</title>
<headline>Worms may open Athena capital - paper.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The chairman of Worms &amp; Cie said in a newspaper interview that the holding company may eventually open the capital of its wholly-owned insurance unit Athena.</p>
<p>&quot;If opportunities arise in the insurance business, we may open the capital of Athena,&quot; Nicholas Clive-Worms told Friday's French business daily Les Echos.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
